  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP-FCDO partnership on Raising Adaptation Impact and Ambition (RAIA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support CLARE&#x2019;s objective of bridging critical gaps between research and action, through developing new evidence &quot;on climate the effectiveness of, and economic case, for climate adaptation&quot; whilst supporting partner governments, academic institutions, communities, and the private sector to use evidence and innovation to drive effective solutions to the climate challenge, whilst building capacity of both those carrying out the research and those using the resulting evidence.</narrative>
  </description>
